  "findings": [
    {
      "title": "[P2] Add regression tests for lock release on success and failure",
      "body": "The new cleanup behavior in `withLock` has no test coverage, and the repository contains no tests at all. Since this PR changes lifecycle-critical semantics (the lock is now released when `work` resolves *and* when it rejects — previously it was never released), tests should exercise a resolving and a rejecting `work` callback and assert that a subsequent acquisition of the same key can proceed. Without coverage, a future refactor could silently reintroduce the leak.",
      "severity": "P2",
